+Jika tampilan layar Minecraft terpotong atau vertikal, aktifkan rotasi otomatis HP dan posisikan layar mendatar (Landscape) sebelum menekan Mainkan.	If the Minecraft screen looks cropped or vertical, enable your phone's auto-rotate and hold the screen in landscape before pressing Play.
